  "limitations": [
    "Headline-scope classification by default: the headline is the only input, so events described only in the body text are missed (a documented Phase 2 limitation).",
    "The source is general-interest political news; a high other_or_uncertain share is expected and is not a bug.",
    "A keyword match is not proof an event happened: negation, threats, and speculation are only flagged (evidence_negated / conditional), not resolved.",
    "Sentiment is text tone, not severity or expected market impact.",
    "affected_sector is not assigned in Phase 2 (optional, manual field in the specification).",
    "Predictions have not been compared with human labels yet: run the review sheet through evaluate_classifier to obtain precision/recall/F1.",
    "The classifier has no notion of past vs new events; an anniversary headline reads the same as a fresh one."
  ],
